\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Self-motion manifold for a fixed end-effector pose. (a) The continuous manifold without joint-limit constraints; (b)--(d) Configurations from the disconnected branches induced by the joint limits, sharing the same pose but differing sharply in joint space and reachable path length. {\color  {darkorange}\begin  {CJK*}{UTF8}{gkai}(e) Joint trajectories of the three branches in b--d along the arc length, with circles marking the joint at its limit: branch\nobreakspace  {}b bounded by $\mathbf  {q}_{1}$ and $\mathbf  {q}_{7}$, branch\nobreakspace  {}c by $\mathbf  {q}_{1}$, and $\mathbf  {q}_{2}$ branch\nobreakspace  {}d by $q_{2}$ and $\mathbf  {q}_{3}$.\end  {CJK*}}{\color  {awesome}\begin  {CJK*}{UTF8}{gkai}\relax \fontsize  {9}{11}\selectfont  \abovedisplayskip 8.5\p@ plus3\p@ minus4\p@ \abovedisplayshortskip \z@ plus2\p@ \belowdisplayshortskip 4\p@ plus2\p@ minus2\p@ \def \leftmargin \leftmargini \parsep 0\p@ plus1\p@ minus\p@ \topsep 8\p@ plus2\p@ minus4\p@ \itemsep 0\p@ {\leftmargin \leftmargini \parsep 0\p@ plus1\p@ minus\p@ \topsep 8\p@ plus2\p@ minus4\p@ \itemsep 0\p@ }\belowdisplayskip \abovedisplayskip 这些branches中间真的没有tunnel吗？\end  {CJK*}}{\color  {darkorange}\begin  {CJK*}{UTF8}{gkai}从理论上来说关节极限会把流形分成disconnected的分支。然后这个图里的例子只剩一个自由度，所以流形是一维曲线，每个分支两端都分别有关节极限，所以要连接两个分支需要跨过极限。但是如果问真的没有tunnel吗我也不了解更多了...这个要怎么调查呢。\end  {CJK*}}{\color  {awesome}\begin  {CJK*}{UTF8}{gkai}\relax \fontsize  {9}{11}\selectfont  \abovedisplayskip 8.5\p@ plus3\p@ minus4\p@ \abovedisplayshortskip \z@ plus2\p@ \belowdisplayshortskip 4\p@ plus2\p@ minus2\p@ \def \leftmargin \leftmargini \parsep 0\p@ plus1\p@ minus\p@ \topsep 8\p@ plus2\p@ minus4\p@ \itemsep 0\p@ {\leftmargin \leftmargini \parsep 0\p@ plus1\p@ minus\p@ \topsep 8\p@ plus2\p@ minus4\p@ \itemsep 0\p@ }\belowdisplayskip \abovedisplayskip b和d看不出区别？另外，每个分支都是哪几个关节标清？\end  {CJK*}}{\color  {darkorange}\begin  {CJK*}{UTF8}{gkai}加了说明性的图片，标明了关节极限范围。\end  {CJK*}}}}{6}{figure.1.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{smm}{{2}{6}{Self-motion manifold for a fixed end-effector pose. (a) The continuous manifold without joint-limit constraints; (b)--(d) Configurations from the disconnected branches induced by the joint limits, sharing the same pose but differing sharply in joint space and reachable path length. \xinyi {(e) Joint trajectories of the three branches in b--d along the arc length, with circles marking the joint at its limit: branch~b bounded by $\mathbf {q}_{1}$ and $\mathbf {q}_{7}$, branch~c by $\mathbf {q}_{1}$, and $\mathbf {q}_{2}$ branch~d by $q_{2}$ and $\mathbf {q}_{3}$.}\wan {这些branches中间真的没有tunnel吗？}\xinyi {从理论上来说关节极限会把流形分成disconnected的分支。然后这个图里的例子只剩一个自由度，所以流形是一维曲线，每个分支两端都分别有关节极限，所以要连接两个分支需要跨过极限。但是如果问真的没有tunnel吗我也不了解更多了...这个要怎么调查呢。}\wan {b和d看不出区别？另外，每个分支都是哪几个关节标清？}\xinyi {加了说明性的图片，标明了关节极限范围。}}{figure.1.2}{}}
